    "root_cause_investigation": "Nighttime recall regressed from 0.3173 to 0.2351 (-25.9% relative) while false positives increased from 81 to 141 (+74.1%). Forensic inspection of the training corpus reveals that out of 667 training frames, only 138 (20.7%) are nighttime captures, all from a single BDD highway sequence (b1d0a191). The model overfit to high-glare highway illumination and suffered negative transfer when presented with urban street glare and low-light sensor noise in sequence b255cd6c."
